--- Independent root-cause confirmation (schema-level, no product-code edits) ---
information_schema.columns: orders.module_id -> IS_NULLABLE=NO, bigint unsigned
information_schema.key_column_usage: orders_module_id_foreign -> module_id REFERENCES modules(id)
  => confirms root cause 1 (unset module_id) is a real NOT NULL + FK violation, not cosmetic.
information_schema.columns on order_details, filtered to ('food_details','item_details'):
  only 'item_details' exists -- 'food_details' is not and was never a real column.
  => confirms root cause 2 (stale 'food_details' key) necessarily throws an unknown-column error.

